  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Health and Border Management in Kyrgyzstan to Respond to COVID-19 and Other Communicable Diseases</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to the efforts of the Government of the Kyrgyz Republic in reducing the spread of COVID-19 and other communicable diseases by strengthening overall health management (prevention, detection, and response to health threats) at the borders&apos; points of entry (PoE). The project will procure prioritized equipment and supplies for PoEs identified in the needs assessment and will strengthen of the capacity of relevant national authorities through simulation exercise trainings.</narrative>
  </description>
